PR #3 — Design token system and global stylesheet
Branch: feat/design-tokens             Depends on: #2                Status: DONE
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DESCRIPTION
  Every colour, space, radius, shadow, duration and type step, defined once.
  This is what makes "no hardcoded values" enforceable rather than aspirational.

IMPLEMENTS
  [x] tokens.css — raw --tk-* values for light, dark and system-default
  [x] Mantine cssVariablesResolver mapping --mantine-* onto --tk-*
  [x] Semantic layer: surface, text-primary/secondary/tertiary, border-default,
      status-pass / status-warn / status-fail / status-manual
  [x] Type scale, spacing scale, radius scale, shadow scale, z-index scale,
      motion durations and easings
  [x] print.css — the print sheet must render correctly on paper
  [x] No-flash init via Mantine ColorSchemeScript; ThemeToggle with all three states
  [x] Token documentation page in Storybook (TokenGallery, rendered from the registry)
  [x] design-tokens.constants.ts — typed registry so nothing hardcodes a token name
  [x] tokens-parity.test.ts — 98 assertions that the three theme states agree

EDGE CASES
  [x] Three theme states, not two — asserted by tokens-parity.test.ts, which
      also proves each theme-dependent token actually differs between light and
      dark, catching the "updated one theme, forgot the other" bug.
  [x] forced-colors mode hands control to system keywords (Canvas, CanvasText,
      GrayText, LinkText) rather than fighting the OS
  [x] prefers-reduced-motion disables every transition
  [x] Status colours lose their hue under forced-colors, which is exactly why
      pass/fail is never signalled by colour alone. The icon + label pairing is
      enforced when RuleResultRow is built in PR #5.
  [x] Print: backgrounds are dropped by default, so cut guides are borders.
      .print-exact-size prevents scale-to-fit, which would ruin a photo sheet.
  [x] Theme flash prevented by ColorSchemeScript before first paint
  [ ] Verify no flash on a throttled CPU — needs the Lighthouse profile from #27

SEO
  [ ] theme-color meta per colour scheme
  [ ] Tokens must not introduce render-blocking CSS beyond the critical file

TESTS
  Unit: token resolution helper. Storybook: swatch pages in both themes.
  Screenshots: token page in light, dark, and forced-colors.

