PR #8 — PhotoSpec schema, Zod validation, registry (US, UK, Schengen)
Branch: feat/photospec-registry        Depends on: #7                Status: TODO
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DESCRIPTION
  The country requirement model. This registry is the moat; the schema decides
  how painful the next 37 countries will be.

IMPLEMENTS
  [ ] PhotoSpec type + Zod schema (print, digital, headHeight, eyeLine,
      background, glasses, headCovering, expression, aiEditingPolicy,
      maxAgeMonths, source, lastVerified)
  [ ] Registry with lookup by (countryIso, documentType)
