EDGE CASES
  [ ] Overlapping/contradictory bands (min > max) must fail the build
  [ ] Head-height expressed as mm in one country and % of frame in another —
      normalise at the boundary, store both, never convert ad hoc later
  [ ] Schengen override merge must be deep and must not silently drop keys
  [ ] Unknown country/document => typed not-found, never a partial object
  [ ] Specs must be immutable at runtime (deep freeze in dev)
  [ ] Two documents in one country with different rules (passport vs visa)
  [ ] Countries with multiple accepted sizes
  [ ] Every spec MUST carry a source URL — build fails without one

SEO
  [ ] lastVerified feeds sitemap lastmod and the visible "verified on" line

TESTS
  Unit: schema validation, merge logic, staleness, every seeded spec parses.
  Fixture: a deliberately invalid spec proves the build gate works.

