PR #14 — Geometry engine
Branch: feat/geometry-engine           Depends on: #13               Status: TODO
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DESCRIPTION
  Landmarks plus crown plus spec, in. Millimetre measurements and the crop
  rectangle, out. Pure functions — no imaging, fully unit-testable.

IMPLEMENTS
  [ ] Head height (crown→chin), eye-line height, horizontal centring
  [ ] Roll from the inter-ocular line; yaw/pitch from the transform matrix
