═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 PARKED — deliberately not in v1
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  - Live camera capture with a real-time guidance overlay  (strong v1.1)
  - Background replacement, only where aiEditingPolicy allows  (v1.1)
  - Glasses detection via a small ONNX classifier  (v1.1, manual until then)
  - Shadow-on-face detection  (v1.1)
  - Any server-side processing                    NEVER
  - Face retouching, smoothing or beautification  NEVER
  - Accounts, uploads or stored photos            NEVER
  - Guaranteeing acceptance                       NEVER
